<https://wifire-data.sdsc.edu/dataset/def234ab-8032-4dbd-988f-b25e7935cc44> <https://schema.org/dateModified> "2019-08-07T23:29:17.000Z" <urn:gleaner.io:eco:wifire:data:02357fe89f61b4eb705dd918f209173ebe81fae1> .
