<https://wifire-data.sdsc.edu/dataset/219970e1-615b-4885-9d69-0e28e3d8f859> <https://schema.org/description> "NCALM Project. PI: Paul Bierman, University of Vermont. The survey area consisted of two polygons: 1) over a portion of the Potomac River in Washington D.C. enclosing 60 square km; and 2) over a portion of the Susquehanna River in Pennsylvania enclosing 23 square km. The Susquehanna survey took place on January 9, 2005 and the Potomac survey took place on January 11, 2005. Publications associated with this dataset can be found at NCALM's Data Tracking Center" <urn:gleaner.io:eco:wifire:data:0657a75ba5077dccc748669b1d571c5e27e9d790> .
