<https://wifire-data.sdsc.edu/dataset/a994c85d-ebbf-4c6f-94ad-476a0da50b13> <https://schema.org/description> "The Fire Potential Index (FPI) assists in making operational decisions that will reduce fire threats and risks. This tool converts environmental, statistical, and scientific data into an easily understood forecast of the short-term fire threat that could exist for different geographical areas in the SDG&E service territory." <urn:gleaner.io:eco:wifire:data:0b05c8fab627eddd56c945622de741ab4ac68c99> .
