<https://wifire-data.sdsc.edu/dataset/052f8c55-0d69-4ec9-bd23-e165f74fc02c> <https://schema.org/description> "Lidar was captured for Otago Regional Council by Landpro between 16 to 18 January 2020. The dataset was generated by Landpro. The survey area includes Balclutha, Kaitangata and Kaka Point, as well as the surrounding Clutha Delta area. Data management and distribution is by Land Information New Zealand. Prepared DEM and DSM files are available through the LINZ Data Service: Balclutha, Otago, New Zealand 2020 Digital Elevation Model Balclutha, Otago, New Zealand 2020 Digital Surface Model" <urn:gleaner.io:eco:wifire:data:0cc4c102d3b45e6577e61af7e36c8ee848d4110b> .
